# TBIs (moody comes with its own popups)
effect-hearing-loss-popup-1 = Your head pounds and your hearing is muffled.
effect-hearing-loss-popup-2 = The ringing in your ears overrides the sounds around you.
effect-hearing-loss-popup-3 = Voices sound distant and muffled.
effect-hearing-loss-popup-4 = It is difficult to follow speech.

effect-paracusia-popup-1 = A sudden rushing fills your ears.
effect-paracusia-popup-2 = The distant murmur of absent voices passes by.
effect-paracusia-popup-3 = Sounds that are not there plague you.
effect-paracusia-popup-4 = Noises that are not real waft through your head.

effect-vision-loss-popup-1 = No matter how many times you rub your eyes, your vision stays blurry.
effect-vision-loss-popup-2 = You cannot blink away the fogginess in your sight.
effect-vision-loss-popup-3 = It is hard to focus on objects farther away.
effect-vision-loss-popup-4 = You have to squint to see details.

effect-woozy-popup-1 = Your head is still spinning as you recover.
effect-woozy-popup-2 = The world seems to sway and shift around you.
effect-woozy-popup-3 = You can tell you will be better soon, but...not just yet.
effect-woozy-popup-4 = Your head is pounding.

# Return damage
effect-burn-return-popup-1 = The raw, healing skin still itches and burns.
effect-burn-return-popup-2 = You can tell you will need to take care of the burn for a while.
effect-burn-return-popup-3 = You know you will be better soon, but...not just yet.
effect-burn-return-popup-4 = The skin where you were burned is tender and painful to the touch.

effect-poison-return-popup-1 = You still feel a little ill from the poison.
effect-poison-return-popup-2 = The toxins slowly work their way out of your body.
effect-poison-return-popup-3 = You can tell you will be better soon, but...not just yet.
effect-poison-return-popup-4 = The poison is still making its way out of your system.

effect-asphyx-return-popup-1 = Your throat feels raw and dry.
effect-asphyx-return-popup-2 = Your chest hurts when you breathe too deep.
effect-asphyx-return-popup-3 = You can tell you will be better soon, but...not just yet.
effect-asphyx-return-popup-4 = It feels difficult to get a deep enough breath.

# Brute damage (pain comes with its own popups)
effect-impaired-mobility-popup-1 = Your body still aches from taking a beating.
effect-impaired-mobility-popup-2 = You get tired so much more easily during recovery.
effect-impaired-mobility-popup-3 = You can tell you will be better soon, but...not just yet.
effect-impaired-mobility-popup-4 = Your body remembers the indignity of pain.

# Notifications for the effect ending
effect-end-popup-1 = You think you are finally feeling better...
effect-end-popup-2 = The lingering effects seem to have passed...
effect-end-popup-3 = You are finally feeling better...
effect-end-popup-4 = You seem to be out of the woods...
